    "detailed_description": "<h1>Extra About the Summer Festival Dress-up Kit</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/f94c58ae73e27a1b0828e42c8c6f65f5.avif?t=1736044933\" width=212 height=300 /></span><br><br>As an added bonus, a PDF file of the Summer Festival Dress-up Kit is included.<br>Print it out, cut it out according to the picture, and play dress-up.<br><br>To find the location of the Summer Festival Dress-up Kit PDF file. 1:<br>1. open the Steam library page. <br>2. Right-click on &quot;Natsukasokomichi&quot; and click &quot;Browse Local Files&quot;. <br>3. Open &quot;satoyamanote_natsukusa_komichi&quot; folder from the opened folder. <br>4. In this folder, you will find &quot;summer_fes_dress_up_kit.pdf&quot; which is the summer festival dress-up kit.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>&quot;In the satoyama  of japan, where nature and humans coexist in harmony.<br>There, a tanuki university was quietly opened,<br>Raccoon dogs and other creatures were studying human culture...&quot;</strong><br><br>The Novel Game &quot;Satoyama note: Natsukusa Komichi&quot; is a novel game about satoyama and its creatures.<br>Tanuki-kun, who studies human culture at Raccoon University, is in a great hurry to study for a test.<br>He remembers going to a summer festival with a fox and a frog.<br>Now, will the test go well?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Novel game depicting the life of living creatures in Satoyama<br></li><li> Live background music by shinobue flute, world depicted by hand-drawn ink paintings<br></li><li> Collect illustrated books and try quiz games!<br></li><li> CG gallery and music player are included!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/267853d3632d4bca8cb8004ba08ba641.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><strong>Story</strong>.<br>The film depicts the life and culture of satoyama creatures.<br>The story progresses from the perspectives of a raccoon dog, fox, frog, and human.<br>A nostalgic and relaxing story of everyday life.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/84388f4cf5e3c9a66d2b8e55ee368f55.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><strong>Satoyama Illustrated books</strong>.<br>There are satoyama illustrated books scattered throughout the text of the story.<br>Let's find and collect them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/2c7dfed485f04b67973012210172f16c.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><strong>Satoyama Test</strong>.<br>Test your knowledge of Satoyama.<br>Try the quiz-style mini-game!<br><br><br><strong>Extra</strong>.<br>See illustrations that were not used in the game,<br>You can listen to your favorite music with the music player!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creatures of Satoyama</h2>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/8ed09ee94357412a1ba0c591ba453523.avif?t=1736044933\" width=300 height=266 /></span>.<br><strong>Tanuki-kun</strong>.<br>(Japanese Raccoon Dog <i>Nyctereutes viverrinus viverrinus</i>)<br>I'm studying human culture at tanuki university.<br>I'm in a big hurry to study for a test.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/b0753c40fed546ec8d6cf81a5f19dcf8.avif?t=1736044933\" width=300 height=276 /></span>)<br><strong>Kitsune-kun</strong>.<br>(Japanese Red Fox <i>Vulpes vulpes japonica</i>)<br>I'm planning to receive various things at the summer festival.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/04275bbc16bb5d5746aefb423876248d.avif?t=1736044933\" width=300 height=296 /></span>)<br><strong>Kaeru-kun</strong>.<br>(Japanese Tree Frog <i>Dryophytes japonicus</i>)<br>He seems to be excited about going to see the fireworks at the summer festival.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;In the satoyama  of japan, where nature and humans coexist in harmony.<br>There, a tanuki university was quietly opened,<br>Raccoon dogs and other creatures were studying human culture...&quot;</strong><br><br>The Novel Game &quot;Satoyama note: Natsukusa Komichi&quot; is a novel game about satoyama and its creatures.<br>Tanuki-kun, who studies human culture at Raccoon University, is in a great hurry to study for a test.<br>He remembers going to a summer festival with a fox and a frog.<br>Now, will the test go well?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Novel game depicting the life of living creatures in Satoyama<br></li><li> Live background music by shinobue flute, world depicted by hand-drawn ink paintings<br></li><li> Collect illustrated books and try quiz games!<br></li><li> CG gallery and music player are included!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/267853d3632d4bca8cb8004ba08ba641.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><strong>Story</strong>.<br>The film depicts the life and culture of satoyama creatures.<br>The story progresses from the perspectives of a raccoon dog, fox, frog, and human.<br>A nostalgic and relaxing story of everyday life.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/84388f4cf5e3c9a66d2b8e55ee368f55.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><strong>Satoyama Illustrated books</strong>.<br>There are satoyama illustrated books scattered throughout the text of the story.<br>Let's find and collect them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673700/extras/2c7dfed485f04b67973012210172f16c.avif?t=1736044933\" width=532 height=300 /></span>.<br><s